      <Layer queryable="1">
        <Name>2</Name>
        <Title><![CDATA[BLM Natl Trails Managed for Public]]></Title>
        <Abstract><![CDATA[BLM Natl Trails Managed for Public layer provides a comprehensive view of all BLM designated trails, and includes whether there are use restrictions (e.g., OHV, mode of transportation) if available or known. These trails have been through the BLM travel management planning process and have a designated asset class as a Trail. Users of this data are encouraged to verify current use limitations and restrictions on these trails with the local BLM office as restrictions may vary from what is depicted in the data. These data are provided by Bureau of Land Management (BLM) "as is" and may contain errors or omissions. The User assumes the entire risk associated with its use of these data and recognizes that this data will never be 100% QCed. Official and accurate data should be obtained directly from the data steward. Please see the metadata of the individual layers for complete details.]]></Abstract>
