      <Layer queryable="1">
        <Name>3</Name>
        <Title><![CDATA[BLM National Scenic or Historic Trails]]></Title>
        <Abstract><![CDATA[The National Scenic and Historic trail layer supports the BLM's recreation opportunities. This map contains data associated with recreational sites and supplemental reference data. Visitors to the public lands enjoy countless types of outdoor adventure – participating in activities as widely varied as camping, hunting, fishing, hiking, horseback riding, boating, whitewater rafting, hang-gliding, off-highway vehicle driving, mountain biking, birding and wildlife viewing, photography, climbing, all types of winter sports, and visiting natural and cultural heritage sites. Please visit the BLM's Recreation website for more information. https://www.blm.gov/programs/recreation.]]></Abstract>
